rice:Light_Brown_Grey_Lesion_Centre a owl:NamedIndividual, rice:Symptom ;
    rdfs:label "lesion with light brown to grey centre"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Centre of a mature brown spot lesion, light brown to grey. A grey centre is also stated for blast (Whitish_Grey_Lesion_Centre), so this feature alone does not separate the two."@en ;
    rice:affectsPlantPart rice:Leaf_Blade .

